######################################################## LIKES
###crear like
POST http://localhost:3000/api/likeMegusta
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idUsuario": 3,
  "idRecuerdo": 2
}

###numero de likes de un comentario
GET http://localhost:3000/api/likeMegusta/comentario/numero/5
###numero de dislikes de un recuerdo
GET http://localhost:3000/api/likeMegusta/recuerdo/numero/2

###eliminar like idLike
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/likeMegusta/9




